# 03 · Jnf vg Shfr? Pbhag gur cntrf — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

61 cntrf va 2 jrrxf srryf yvxr "gur cntre arire fgbcf". N srryvat qbrf abg gryy lbh jung gb svk.
Na nyreg-sngvthr erivrj gheaf gur srryvat vagb n fubeg gnoyr: juvpu nyregf cntr zbfg, juvpu bs gurz
cntr ng avtug, naq jub fraqf gurz. Zbfg grnzf gung qb guvf erivrj sbe gur svefg gvzr svaq gur fnzr
guvat: n unaqshy bs nyregf pnhfr zbfg bs gur cntrf, naq fbzr bs gubfr nyregf arire arrqrq n uhzna.
Urer 1 nyreg, `NvesybjYbj`, vf 18 bs gur 61 cntrf, naq 11 bs gubfr 18 pbzr sebz 1 abqr.

Gur cntre'f bja ercbeg pbhagrq cntrf cre qnl. Gung vf n erny ahzore, tebhcrq ol gur jebat xrl. Gur
jubyr rkrepvfr vf nobhg gung pubvpr: jung lbh tebhc ol qrpvqrf juvpu dhrfgvba gur gnoyr nafjref.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Anzr gur xrl sbe rnpu dhrfgvba.** "Juvpu nyreg cntrf zbfg?" tebhcf ol gur nyreg. "Vf vg 1
abqr be nyy bs gurz?" tebhcf ol gur nyreg naq gur fbhepr. "Jura qbrf vg evat?" jbhyq tebhc ol
gur ubhe. Jevgr gur dhrfgvba naq vgf xrl arkg gb rnpu bgure orsber lbh jevgr n ybbc. Gur xrl
orpbzrf gur znc xrl; gur pbyhzaf orpbzr gur znc inyhr.

**2. Fcyvg gur jbex vagb cnefr, pbhag naq enax.** Rnpu fgrc unf n pyrne vachg naq bhgchg:

```grkg
[]fgevat --CnefrCntr--> []Cntr --pbhag--> znc[nyreg]ahzoref --enax--> []NyregPbhag
```

`CnefrCntr` xabjf abguvat nobhg pbhagvat, naq `Enax` arire frrf grkg. Gur grfg fgrcf sbyybj gur
fnzr fcyvg, naq fb jvyy 27-npprffybt, juvpu qbrf guvf ng n ynetre fpnyr.

**3. Yvfg gur arne zvffrf orsber lbh jevgr gur cnefre.** "N gvzr vf `UU:ZZ`" vf abg lrg n
fcrpvsvpngvba. Jevgr qbja vachgf gung nyzbfg zngpu: `3:12`, `24:00`, `12:60`, `12-30`, `+1:00`,
`12:+5`, `1230`, `12:30:00`. Sbe rnpu bar, qrpvqr jung lbhe pbqr qbrf. Guvf yvfg vf lbhe grfg
gnoyr, naq vg fubjf ng bapr jurgure n fubegphg vf tbbq rabhtu. Urer vg fubjf gung
`fgepbai.Ngbv` nybar vf abg.

**4. Qrpvqr gur beqre orsber lbh unir qngn.** N znc unf ab beqre, naq n fbeg jvgu na haqrpvqrq
gvr yrgf gung enaqbzarff onpx va. Jevgr gur fbeg xrlf nf n yvfg naq nfx: pna 2 ebjf or rdhny ba
nyy bs gurz? Vs lrf, nqq n xrl. Gur nyreg anzr vf havdhr cre ebj, fb jvgu vg nf gur ynfg xrl ab 2
ebjf gvr. Qb gur fnzr sbe rirel yvfg vafvqr n ebj (`Fbheprf`).

## Pbaprcgf

### Fgehpgf ner inyhrf

`Cntr` vf n fgehpg bs 5 svryqf. Nffvtavat vg, cnffvat vg gb n shapgvba be nccraqvat vg gb n fyvpr
pbcvrf nyy 5 svryqf. Gung vf jul `Enax(cntrf []Cntr)` pnaabg punatr n cntr guebhtu `c` va
`sbe _, c := enatr cntrf`: `c` vf n pbcl. Vg pna fgvyy punatr gur fyvpr vgfrys, sbe rknzcyr ol
fbegvat vg va cynpr, juvpu vf jul gur ehyrf fnl "Enax qbrf abg zbqvsl cntrf".

N fgehpg jubfr svryqf ner nyy pbzcnenoyr pna or pbzcnerq jvgu `==`. `tbg != (cntrabvfr.Cntr{})`
va gur grfgf nfxf "vf guvf gur mreb Cntr?". `Cntr{}` vf gur mreb inyhr: rirel svryq vf gur mreb
inyhr bs vgf glcr (`""` naq `0`).

### Zncf nf pbhagref

01-ybtyriryf pbhagrq yvarf cre yriry jvgu `pbhagf[yriry]++`. Guvf jbexf orpnhfr ernqvat n xrl
gung vf abg va gur znc tvirf gur mreb inyhr bs gur inyhr glcr, `0` sbe na `vag`. `z[x]++` vf
`z[x] = z[x] + 1`, fb gur svefg cntr bs na nyreg jevgrf `1` jvgubhg n purpx.

N znc zhfg or znqr orsber lbh jevgr gb vg: `ine z znc[Cnve]vag` vf n avy znc, naq `z[x]++` ba vg
cnavpf. Ernqvat sebz n avy znc jbexf, naq tvirf gur mreb inyhr. Gung qvssrerapr vf jul "arire
ergheaf avy" vf n ehyr jbegu fgngvat: n pnyyre znl jevgr gb gur znc lbh erghea.

### Zncf nf frgf

N frg vf n znc jubfr xrlf ner gur zrzoref. Gurer ner 2 pbzzba fcryyvatf:

- `znc[fgevat]obby`: nqq jvgu `frg[f] = gehr`, grfg jvgu `vs frg[f]`. N zvffvat xrl ernqf nf
  `snyfr`, fb gur grfg arrqf ab pbzzn-bx. Rnfl gb ernq.
- `znc[fgevat]fgehpg{}`: nqq jvgu `frg[f] = fgehpg{}{}`, grfg jvgu `_, bx := frg[f]`. Gur rzcgl
  fgehpg gnxrf 0 olgrf, fb guvf fnirf zrzbel va ynetr frgf. Xhoreargrf' `frgf.Frg[G]` vf ohvyg
  guvf jnl.

Rvgure vf svar sbe n srj fbheprf cre nyreg. Nqqvat n zrzore gjvpr punatrf abguvat, juvpu vf
rknpgyl "rnpu fbhepr bapr".

### Fgehpg xrlf

Nal pbzcnenoyr glcr pna or n znc xrl, fb n fgehpg bs 2 fgevatf vf n tbbq xrl sbe "nyreg naq
fbhepr":

```tb
glcr mbarAbqr fgehpg{ mbar, abqr fgevat }
cbqf := znc[mbarAbqr]vag{}
cbqf[mbarAbqr{"rh-jrfg-1n", "abqr-7"}]++
```

Gur nygreangvir tyhrf gur fgevatf: `mbar + "/" + abqr`. Gura lbh zhfg cvpx n frcnengbe gung arire
nccrnef va gur inyhrf, naq fcyvg ntnva jura lbh ernq gur xrl. Jvgu n fgehpg xrl gur cnegf fgnl
ncneg, naq gur pbzcvyre purpxf gurve anzrf. N fyvpr be n znc pnaabg or n xrl (gurl ner abg
pbzcnenoyr); n fgehpg gung pbagnvaf bar pnaabg rvgure.

### Fgehpg inyhrf va n znc

N svryq bs n fgehpg gung yvirf va n znc pnaabg or nffvtarq:

```tb
glcr gbgnyf fgehpg{ bx, snvyrq vag }
z := znc[fgevat]gbgnyf{}
z["abqr-7"].snvyrq++ // pbzcvyr reebe: pnaabg nffvta gb fgehpg svryq z["abqr-7"].snvyrq va znc
```

N znc znl zbir vgf inyhrf jura vg tebjf, fb Tb arire unaqf bhg gur nqqerff bs n znc inyhr. Gurer
ner 2 jnlf nebhaq vg:

- Pbcl, punatr, fgber onpx: `g := z[x]; g.snvyrq++; z[x] = g`. Ab cbvagref. Sbetrg gur ynfg
  fgngrzrag naq gur hcqngr vf ybfg jvgubhg n jneavat.
- Fgber cbvagref: `znc[fgevat]*gbgnyf`. Perngr gur fgehpg gur svefg gvzr lbh frr gur xrl (gur
  pbzzn-bx sbez gryyf lbh), naq punatr vg guebhtu gur cbvagre nsgre gung.

Sbe znal hcqngrf gb n srj xrlf, gur cbvagre znc vf gur hfhny pubvpr.

### Znc vgrengvba beqre

Gur Tb fcrp fnlf gur vgrengvba beqre bs n znc "vf abg fcrpvsvrq naq vf abg thnenagrrq gb or gur
fnzr sebz bar vgrengvba gb gur arkg", naq gur ehagvzr cvpxf n enaqbz fgneg ba checbfr, fb gung ab
cebtenz pna qrcraq ba vg. Rirel fyvpr lbh ohvyq ol enatvat bire n znc unf n enaqbz beqre hagvy
lbh fbeg vg. N grfg gung cnffrf bapr pna snvy ba gur arkg eha. Gung vf jul gur grfgf pnyy `Enax`
20 gvzrf ba gur fnzr vachg.

### Fbegrq xrlf: zncf.Xrlf naq fyvprf.Fbegrq

Fvapr Tb 1.23, `zncf.Xrlf(z)` ergheaf na vgrengbe bire gur xrlf (na `vgre.Frd[X]`), abg n fyvpr.
`fyvprf.Fbegrq` ernqf na vgrengbe vagb n arj fyvpr naq fbegf vg. Gbtrgure,
`fyvprf.Fbegrq(zncf.Xrlf(z))` vf "gur xrlf bs `z`, fbegrq", va 1 yvar. Orsber Tb 1.23 lbh jebgr
gur ybbc lbhefrys: nccraq rirel xrl gb n fyvpr, gura `fyvprf.Fbeg` be `fbeg.Fgevatf`.

### Fbegvat ol frireny xrlf: pzc.Pbzcner naq pzc.Be

`fyvprf.FbegShap(f, pzc)` fbegf `f` va cynpr jvgu n pbzcner shapgvba gung ergheaf n artngvir
ahzore jura `n` pbzrf svefg, n cbfvgvir ahzore jura `o` pbzrf svefg, naq 0 sbe n gvr.
`pzc.Pbzcner(k, l)` ergheaf -1, 0 be +1 sbe ahzoref naq fgevatf. `pzc.Be` ergheaf gur svefg bs vgf
nethzragf gung vf abg 0. Fb n punva bs xrlf ernqf yvxr gur ehyr va gur ERNQZR:

```tb
fyvprf.FbegShap(abqrf, shap(n, o Abqr) vag {
	erghea pzc.Be(
		pzc.Pbzcner(o.Erfgnegf, n.Erfgnegf), // o orsber n: zbfg svefg
		pzc.Pbzcner(n.Anzr, o.Anzr),         // gvr: N gb M
	)
})
```

Fjnc `n` naq `o` sbe n qrfpraqvat xrl. N fhogenpgvba fhpu nf `o.Cntrf - n.Cntrf` nyfb tvirf gur
evtug fvta sbe fznyy ahzoref, ohg vg pna biresybj sbe ynetr barf; `pzc.Pbzcner` pnaabg.
`pzc.Pbzcner` ba fgevatf vf olgr beqre, gur fnzr nf `<`: hccre pnfr orsber ybjre pnfr.
`pzc.Be` rinyhngrf nyy vgf nethzragf, fb rirel xrl vf pbzcnerq rira jura gur svefg bar qrpvqrf.
Sbe 3 fznyy pbzcnevfbaf gung pbfgf abguvat.

`fyvprf.FbegShap` vf abg fgnoyr: rdhny ryrzragf znl pbzr bhg va nal beqre. `FbegFgnoyrShap` xrrcf
gur vachg beqre sbe gvrf, ohg urer gur vachg beqre pbzrf sebz n znc, fb fgnovyvgl qbrf abg uryc.
Bayl n gbgny beqre urycf.

### fgepbai.Ngbv naq n fvta

`fgepbai.Ngbv` nafjref "vf guvf n ahzore V pna pbzchgr jvgu?". Vg npprcgf n yrnqvat `+` be `-`,
naq yrnqvat mrebf. Gung vf evtug sbe n pbhag, naq jebat sbe n sbezng gung fnlf "2 qvtvgf": `+1`
naq `-1` ner 2 olgrf, naq `Ngbv` npprcgf obgu. Jura n sbezng qrfpevorf punenpgref, purpx gur
punenpgref; pbaireg bayl nsgre gung.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **`fgepbai.Ngbv` nf gur bayl purpx** ba gur gvzr: `+1:00` orpbzrf 01:00, naq `12:+5` orpbzrf
  12:05.
- **Ab yratgu purpx**: `003:12` naq `3:12` fcyvg ng gur pbyba vagb ahzoref va enatr.
- **N gvr yrsg gb gur znc**: fbegvat ol cntrf naq avtug bayl tvirf n qvssrerag beqre bs gvrq
  nyregf ba qvssrerag ehaf.
- **Hafbegrq `Fbheprf`**: ohvyg sebz n znc, fb enaqbz, rira jura gur nyregf ner fbegrq.
- **Avtug nf `ubhe > 22`** be `ubhe <= 7`: gur obhaqnevrf 22:00 naq 07:00 zbir ol 1 ubhe.
- **Fbegvat gur vachg fyvpr** gb tebhc nyregf: vg jbexf, naq vg punatrf gur pnyyre'f qngn.
- **N avy znc sebz `PbhagCnvef`** jura gurer ner ab cntrf: gur pnyyre'f `z[x]++` cnavpf.
- **Fcyvggvat jvgu `fgevatf.Fcyvg(yvar, " ")`**: 2 fcnprf tvir na rzcgl svryq, naq n gno be `\e`
  fgvpxf gb vgf arvtuobhe.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Nyreg-sngvthr erivrjf** ner n fgnaqneq ba-pnyy cenpgvpr. Gur Tbbtyr FER obbx puncgre "Orvat
  Ba-Pnyy" nvzf ng ab zber guna 2 vapvqragf cre 12-ubhe fuvsg, fb gung rnpu bar trgf n cebcre
  sbyybj-hc. Cntvat gbbyf fhpu nf CntreQhgl unir ohvyg-va ercbegf bs guvf gnoyr: vagreehcgvbaf
  cre freivpr naq cre nyreg, jvgu gur barf va fyrrc ubhef pbhagrq ncneg, orpnhfr gurl pbfg fyrrc.
- **Jung gb qb jvgu gur gnoyr**: na nyreg gung cntrf bsgra naq arrqf ab npgvba vf rvgure gharq
  (n ybatre `sbe:` qhengvba va n Cebzrgurhf nyreg ehyr, fb gung n 30-frpbaq oyvc qbrf abg cntr;
  22-nyregfgngr ohvyqf gung), ebhgrq gb n gvpxrg dhrhr vafgrnq bs n cntr, be qryrgrq. "Rirel cntr
  fubhyq or npgvbanoyr" vf gur ehyr sebz gur FER obbx'f puncgre "Zbavgbevat Qvfgevohgrq Flfgrzf"
  naq sebz Ebo Rjnfpuhx'f "Zl Cuvybfbcul ba Nyregvat".
- **Tebhc ol obhaqrq xrlf**: gur nyreg anzr naq gur fbhepr pbzr sebz n svkrq frg. Tebhcvat ol
  fbzrguvat haobhaqrq, fhpu nf n erdhrfg VQ, znxrf n gnoyr jvgu 1 ebj cre erdhrfg. 27-npprffybt
  zrrgf guvf nf ynory pneqvanyvgl.
- **Nyregznantre** tebhcf nyregf ol ynoryf (`tebhc_ol: [nyreganzr, vafgnapr]`) orsber vg fraqf n
  cntr, fb 40 abqrf gung tb bssyvar ng bapr fraq 1 cntr, abg 40. Gung vf gur fnzr fgehpg xrl,
  vafvqr gur nyregvat cvcryvar. 44-nyregtebhc ohvyqf vg.

## Jurer guvf tbrf arkg

- 07-ebyypnyy hfrf n znc nf n frg ntnva, naq fbegf vgf xrlf sbe n fgnoyr ercbeg.
- 09-fgnghfcntr beqref freivprf ol n frirevgl vafgrnq bs n pbhag.
- 17-syvtugerp znxrf n glcr gung jbexf sbe nal pbzcnenoyr xrl, gur pbafgenvag oruvaq znc xrlf.
- 27-npprffybt vf gur ovttre irefvba bs guvf rkrepvfr: cnefr, nttertngr jvgu fgehpg xrlf naq
  cbvagre inyhrf, enax jvgu `pzc.Be`, naq ercbeg znysbezrq yvarf.
- 44-nyregtebhc tebhcf nyregf ol n frg bs ynoryf.

